        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Purgatory</strong> – a unique Streamer interactive management simulation game, where you take on the role of the absolute leader of a group seeking freedom. Whether you are a new Streamer familiarizing yourself with game mechanics or a player who loves tactical survival, <strong>Purgatory</strong> will challenge your management and decision-making skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, you hold all the resources and strategies needed to lead your group out of danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🖥️ Streamer Dashboard: The Secret Control Center</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even when playing in Offline mode, you maintain absolute control through the <strong>Streamer Dashboard</strong> – a unique hidden management interface that allows you to control the environment:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor simulated statistics for &quot;viewers&quot; and &quot;donators.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate events and adjust parameters for the Game Client.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983490/extras/1cbc881cd6f11df00c82650f4c6df2b4.avif?t=1765897031\" width=1392 height=718 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Core Gameplay Mechanism: 2 Strategic Phases</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game revolves around the journey of survival and escape, divided into two main strategic phases:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phase 1: Preparation &amp; Survival (Working Phase)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are responsible for <strong>Macro-management</strong> of resources, gathering and allocating <strong>raw materials</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make crucial decisions regarding equipment purchases and facility upgrades in preparation for the journey ahead.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983490/extras/0b83dc287c8811b0866027ea4b93deeb.avif?t=1765897031\" width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Phase 2: The Escape</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under your command, the characters will begin their escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is to issue tactical commands and use support skills to guide the group past obstacles and go <strong>as far as possible</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983490/extras/83b846321b8c8aa5fc52e7dab356c598.avif?t=1765897031\" width=1560 height=874 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Purgatory</strong> – a unique Streamer interactive management simulation game, where you take on the role of the absolute leader of a group seeking freedom. Whether you are a new Streamer familiarizing yourself with game mechanics or a player who loves tactical survival, <strong>Purgatory</strong> will challenge your management and decision-making skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, you hold all the resources and strategies needed to lead your group out of danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🖥️ Streamer Dashboard: The Secret Control Center</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even when playing in Offline mode, you maintain absolute control through the <strong>Streamer Dashboard</strong> – a unique hidden management interface that allows you to control the environment:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor simulated statistics for &quot;viewers&quot; and &quot;donators.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate events and adjust parameters for the Game Client.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983490/extras/1cbc881cd6f11df00c82650f4c6df2b4.avif?t=1765897031\" width=1392 height=718 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Core Gameplay Mechanism: 2 Strategic Phases</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game revolves around the journey of survival and escape, divided into two main strategic phases:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phase 1: Preparation &amp; Survival (Working Phase)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are responsible for <strong>Macro-management</strong> of resources, gathering and allocating <strong>raw materials</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make crucial decisions regarding equipment purchases and facility upgrades in preparation for the journey ahead.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983490/extras/0b83dc287c8811b0866027ea4b93deeb.avif?t=1765897031\" width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Phase 2: The Escape</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under your command, the characters will begin their escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is to issue tactical commands and use support skills to guide the group past obstacles and go <strong>as far as possible</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983490/extras/83b846321b8c8aa5fc52e7dab356c598.avif?t=1765897031\" width=1560 height=874 /></span></p>",
